abstract: >-
  Code and data for a cross-domain benchmark of LLM-simulated human survey
  responses. Four LLMs are evaluated on the General Social Survey and the
  World Values Survey against non-LLM baselines fit on held-out human data.
  Includes 50,076 cached model calls enabling fully offline reproduction.
keywords:
  - large language models
  - synthetic users
  - survey simulation
  - evaluation benchmark
